        <!-- Good Touch -->
        <div id="goodtouch" class="story-panel hidden">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-hand-paper" style="color:var(--primary);"></i> Good Touch & Bad Touch</h3>
            <p><strong>Good touch</strong> makes you feel safe, happy, and cared for. A hug from a parent, a high-five from a friend, or a doctor checking you with your parents present.</p>
            <p><strong>Bad touch</strong> makes you feel scared, confused, or uncomfortable. It is when someone touches your private parts, or asks you to touch theirs, or makes you feel weird.</p>

            <div class="diagram-container">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 300 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Body safety diagram showing private parts in red">
                    <circle cx="150" cy="60" r="45" fill="#FFE0B2" stroke="#2d2d44" stroke-width="3"/>
